{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l4bupwny","slideIndex":4,"position":{"left":274.22,"top":150,"width":930,"height":110.4},"name":"TextBox 5","text":"Base system: a working Streamlit financial-news dashboard using NewsAPI, Marketaux, and Finnhub adapters, article deduplication/relevance ranking, and ProsusAI FinBERT tone classification.\nRelated research motivates financial NLP and attention measures. The repository’s prior return experiment reported weak out-of-sample persistence; it is preliminary and not reproduced for this presentation.","geometry":"rect","style":{"fontSize":21,"typeface":"Garamond","color":"#222222","alignment":"left"}}
